  "answer_text": "There are many great options for ordering a birthday cake online! Here are some popular ones:\n\n1. **[Bake Me A Wish](https://www.bakemeawish.com/order-cakes.php)** \u2013 They offer a wide variety of cakes including Strawberry Funfetti Cake, Chocolate Strawberry Cake, Gluten-Free options, and personalized cakes, with prices starting around $40.\n\n2. **[Goldbelly](https://www.goldbelly.com/foods/cakes)** \u2013 They curate standout cakes from America's most famous bakeries, featuring favorites like chocolate cakes, red velvet cakes, birthday cakes, cookie cakes, bundt cakes, and more \u2014 all shipped nationwide.\n\n3. **[Harry & David](https://www.harryanddavid.com/h/bakery/cakes)** \u2013 Their gourmet cakes and specialty desserts are handcrafted in their Southern Oregon bakery and delivered nationwide, with flavors including rich chocolate, classic vanilla, and seasonal favorites.\n\n4. **[Milk Bar](https://milkbarstore.com/products/birthday-cake)** \u2013 Their bestselling Birthday Cake, inspired by the boxed vanilla funfetti cake, features three tiers of rainbow-flecked vanilla birthday cake, layers of creamy frosting & crunchy crumbs, all topped with rainbow sprinkles. They ship nationwide and deliver 7 days a week, Monday\u2013Sunday.\n\n5. **[Send A Cake](https://sendacake.com/)** \u2013 They specialize in surprise cake gifts that bring laughter and smiles, with unique birthday and holiday gift ideas.\n\n6. **[Edible Arrangements](https://www.ediblearrangements.com/birthday-cakes)** \u2013 Gifting has never been easier with Edible's same-day gift delivery.\n\n7. **[1-800-Flowers](https://www.1800flowers.com/birthday-cake-delivery)** \u2013 A well-known gifting service that also offers birthday cake delivery nationwide.\n\n8. **[Uber Eats](https://www.ubereats.com/)** \u2013 You can also enjoy cake delivery with Uber Eats from local bakeries near you, with your order delivered in minutes.\n\nEach of these platforms offers something a little different \u2014 from gourmet artisan cakes to fun surprise boxes \u2014 so you can choose what best fits your needs and budget! \ud83c\udf82",
